WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.160
Two speakers, side by side, are
connected to the same signal generator.

2
00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:09.370
Both play one steady note: 850 hertz.

3
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:13.020
Stand in front of them, and
the note is loud and clear.

4
00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.060
Take one step sideways.

5
00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.370
The note almost vanishes.

6
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.320
Neither speaker has changed.

7
00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:23.820
So how can one step sideways
make the sound almost disappear?

8
00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:28.670
In this mission, you'll see what happens
when two waves meet in the same place.

9
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:32.420
Then you'll add two waves
on a graph, point by point.

10
00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:37.720
Your mission: explain how one step
sideways can make the sound almost vanish.
